; Brawler mode director announcements ([Brawler] DirectorLines in the config)
;
; When the director makes the fight easier or harder, drops an item for a
; player in trouble, a wave starts or is cleared, or a player goes down, comes
; back or joins, it says so with a short line in the upper center of the
; screen ([Brawler] DirectorTalk = 1).
; One line is picked at random, never the same one twice in a row.
; {player} is replaced by the player the decision is about (1P, 2P...).
; Lines with {player} are only used for decisions about one player.
; Keep lines short: about 40 characters fit.

[Easier]
; The director gives the players room: be encouraging
line = Hang in there!
line = Catch your breath.
line = Don't give up now!
line = You've got this!
line = Stay on your feet!
line = Shake it off, {player}!
line = Breathe, {player}. I'll hold them back.
line = Keep fighting, {player}!

[Harder]
; The director turns up the heat: be challenging
line = Too easy? Let's fix that.
line = Warming up? Here comes more!
line = Show me what you've got!
line = Let's see you handle this!
line = No more holding back!
line = Getting comfortable, {player}?
line = Think you're tough, {player}?
line = {player} wants more. Granted!

[Help]
; The director drops an item next to a player in trouble ([Level] help):
; always said, even right after another line
line = Here, {player}, eat up!
line = Hang on, {player}! Take this.
line = {player}, grab that and get back up!
line = Don't quit on me, {player}! Food's here.

[Wave]
; A wave starts: get the players going
line = Here they come!
line = Heads up!
line = Company's here. Show them out!
line = Look alive, they're coming!

[Boss]
; A wave with a boss starts
line = Here comes the big one!
line = This one won't go down easy.
line = Now the real fight begins!

[Cleared]
; A wave is cleared
line = Nicely done.
line = Area clear!
line = That's how it's done!
line = Not bad. Keep moving!

[Close]
; A wave is cleared after a player was in real trouble in it
; ({player}: that player)
line = That was close!
line = Still standing? Impressive.
line = Phew! You made it, {player}.
line = Close one, {player}. Breathe.

[Down]
; A player goes down while others fight on ({player}: the one down)
line = {player} is down! Hold the line!
line = Cover for {player}!
line = Lost {player}! Don't let up!
line = {player} needs a breather. Keep them busy!

[Back]
; A player who was down is back in the fight
line = Welcome back, {player}!
line = {player} is back in it!
line = Look who's up again: {player}!

[Join]
; A player joins during the level
line = {player} joins the fight!
line = Fresh fists! Welcome, {player}!
line = Reinforcements! Go get 'em, {player}!

[Relax]
; The fight peaked: the director gives the team a breather
line = Catch your breath!
line = Take five. You earned it.
line = Easy now. Regroup!
line = Breathe. They're waiting for you.

[Resume]
; The breather is over
line = Break's over!
line = Rested? Here we go again!
line = Back to work!
line = Round two. Ready?

[Victory]
; The level is cleared and the team lost little life for what it defeated
line = Level clear! Nicely done.
line = Not a scratch on you. Almost.
line = That's how it's done!
line = Clean work. On to the next one!

[Survived]
; The level is cleared, but it was rough
line = Made it. Barely.
line = Bruised, but standing. Good enough!
line = That one hurt. Patch up and move on.
line = Survived! Next time, guard more.

[LastStand]
; Co-op: a player goes down and only one is left standing ({player}: the one
; still standing). The director also keeps fewer enemies on screen for them
line = {player}, you're on your own!
line = Hold the fort, {player}!
line = It's all on you now, {player}!
line = Last one standing: show them, {player}!

[BossLow]
; A boss is down to a quarter of its life
line = It's almost done! Finish it!
line = One more push!
line = It's wobbling. Take it down!

[BossDown]
; A boss is defeated (said instead of the wave or level line when it was
; the last enemy)
line = The big one's down!
line = Boss down! Who's next?
line = And stay down!

[Combo]
; A combo of at least "hits" hits by the players. Named after the player
; when only one plays
hits = 8
line = Nice combo!
line = Now that's a combo!
line = What a combo, {player}!
line = Keep it rolling, {player}!
